

resolvectl service _ssh._tcp local

* avahi

Avahi provides local hostname resolution using a "hostname.local"
 avahi-browse --all --ignore-local --resolve --terminate

avahi exposes several tools such as:
- avahi-browse -a
- avahi-publish
- avahi-resolve
- avahi-set-host-name

